# Hooks + LangSmith

- Config: `.cursor/hooks.json` — registry `.sdlc/hooks.yaml`
- Lib: `.cursor/hooks/_lib/langsmith_emit.py`
- Deps: `pip install -r .sdlc/requirements-hooks.txt`
- LangSmith project: `rpg-op-cursor` via `LANGCHAIN_PROJECT`

## Pre hooks

Block writes to `generated/`; redact secrets in prompts; audit shell/MCP.

## Post hooks

Emit runs to LangSmith; local fallback `.sdlc/logs/cursor-hooks.jsonl`.

## Do not

- Log raw API keys
- Disable hooks without updating `.sdlc/hooks.yaml`

Skill: `.sdlc/skills/langsmith-observability/SKILL.md`
